OL,1,W5j 5Q5 7575747575x0w1w1 w17571
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAFamily calls for more kidney
OL,4,Adisease support
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut after she was sick at school,
OL,7,Ffurther medical checks revealed very
OL,8,Fhigh blood pressure, and tests at
OL,9,FEvelina London Children's Hospital led
OL,10,Fto a diagnosis of ANCA vasculitis and
OL,11,Fkidney failure, and she started
OL,12,Fdialysis immediately.
OL,14,FNow 13, Lara says she feels like she
OL,15,F"missed out on so much" due to
OL,16,Fappointments or being unwell, and has
OL,17,Fjoined others at the House of Commons
OL,18,Ffor the launch of a new report looking
OL,19,Fat the impact of childhood kidney
OL,20,Fdisease.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
